# cargo's dependencies (design/caos-expr.md, Phase 3; format `<path> <name>`,
# path relative to this dir). cargo's flake is built by the flake-builder, named
# here as a LOCAL dep (mounted at DEEP-DEPS/flake-builder by deepening) — the
# only way it CAN be named, since nothing resolves a builtin by name.
../flake-builder flake-builder
# The lock, SHARED rather than copied: one `flake.lock` at the repo root pins
# every flake in the tree, and the flake-builder places it (`--lock` below).
# nix takes a superset happily — it resolves the inputs this flake declares and
# prunes the rest.
../../flake.lock flake.lock
